 "segments": [
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Bu Xiaogu is managing to confirm guest singer Li Mingji, just as her colleagues secure Xin Huimei.",
   "gap": 0.8
  },
  {
   "v": "bu_xiaogu",
   "t": "喂，您好，这里是星天娱乐。",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "bu_xiaogu",
   "t": "凯文哥，已经敲定那边的档期，好。刚才提了好多要求啊。",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "kaiwen",
   "t": "喂，你说。",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "xingzi",
   "t": "辛惠美要来上节目了。",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "kaiwen",
   "t": "搞定？真的假的？",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "kaiwen",
   "t": "漂亮！",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "kaiwen",
   "t": "辛惠美搞定了！",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "bu_xiaogu",
   "t": "李铭基的事交给我了。",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "In the office, Bu Xiaogu finally gets a difficult guest star on the line.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "bu_xiaogu",
   "t": "喂，您好，这里是星天娱乐。",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Hello, this is Xingtian Entertainment.' She says \"zheli shi\", literally 'here is', followed by the company name.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "bu_xiaogu",
   "t": "凯文哥，已经敲定那边的档期，好。刚才提了好多要求啊。",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Brother Kaiwen, we've already finalized their schedule, good. They raised so many demands just now.' She confirms the booking using \"qiaoding\" for 'finalize'.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "kaiwen",
   "t": "喂，你说。",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Hello, speak.' Kaiwen picks up his own ringing phoneone and answers with \"wei\", 'hello'.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "xingzi",
   "t": "辛惠美要来上节目了。",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Xin Huimei is coming to appear on the program.' Xingzi delivers the news using \"shang\", 'go up', for appearing on a show.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "kaiwen",
   "t": "搞定？真的假的？",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Done? Real or fake?' He asks if it is \"zhende\", 'real', or \"jiade\", 'fake'.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "kaiwen",
   "t": "漂亮！",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Beautiful!' The word \"piaoliang\" means 'beautiful', but it is also used to cheer a fantastic outcome.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "kaiwen",
   "t": "辛惠美搞定了！",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Xin Huimei is settled!' He announces the breakthrough with \"gaoding le\", meaning 'settled' or 'done'.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "bu_xiaogu",
   "t": "李铭基的事交给我了。",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'The Li Mingji matter is left to me.' Xiaogu chimes in using \"jiao gei\", 'hand over to'. Let's review the scene.",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "v": "bu_xiaogu",
   "t": "喂，您好，这里是星天娱乐。",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "v": "bu_xiaogu",
   "t": "凯文哥，已经敲定那边的档期，好。刚才提了好多要求啊。",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "v": "kaiwen",
   "t": "喂，你说。",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "v": "xingzi",
   "t": "辛惠美要来上节目了。",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "v": "kaiwen",
   "t": "搞定？真的假的？",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "v": "kaiwen",
   "t": "漂亮！",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "v": "kaiwen",
   "t": "辛惠美搞定了！",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
